OMISE® GRANTS. THE FOUNDATION'S NATIONAL NEIGHBORHOOD PROMISE PROGRAM AIMS TO REVITALIZE COMMUNITIES AND THE QUALITY OF LIFE OF RESIDENTS THROUGH VOLUNTEER PROJECTS, MONETARY DONATIONS AND IN-KIND SERVICES."}{'symbol': 'ROK', 'date': '2023-03-22 18:15:00', 'title': 'GLANCY PRONGAY & MURRAY LLP, A LEADING SECURITIES FRAUD LAW FIRM, ANNOUNCES INVESTIGATION OF ROCKWELL AUTOMATION, INC. (ROK) ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS', 'text': "LOS ANGELES--(BUSINESS WIRE)--GLANCY PRONGAY & MURRAY LLP (“GPM”), A LEADING NATIONAL SHAREHOLDER RIGHTS LAW FIRM, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS COMMENCED AN INVESTIGATION ON BEHALF OF ROCKWELL AUTOMATION, INC. (“ROCKWELL” OR THE “COMPANY”) (NYSE: ROK) INVESTORS CONCERNING THE COMPANY'S POSSIBLE VIOLATIONS OF THE FEDERAL SECURITIES LAWS."}{'symbol': 'ROK', 'date': '2023-03-22 16:31:00', 'title': 'INVESTOR ALERT: LAW OFFICES OF HOWARD G. SMITH ANNOUNCES INVESTIGATION OF ROCKWELL AUTOMATION, INC. (ROK) ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS', 'text': "BENSALEM, PA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--LAW OFFICES OF HOWARD G. SMITH ANNOUNCES AN INVESTIGATION ON BEHALF OF ROCKWELL AUTOMATION, INC. (“ROCKWELL” OR THE “COMPANY”) (NYSE: ROK) INVESTORS CONCERNING THE COMPANY'S POSSIBLE VIOLATIONS OF FEDERAL SECURITIES LAWS. ON MAY 3, 2022, BEFORE THE MARKET OPENED, ROCKWELL RELEASED ITS SECOND QUARTER 2022 FINANCIAL RESULTS, REVEALING A NET INCOME DECLINE OF $361.1 MILLION COMPARED TO THE SECOND QUARTER OF 2021."}{'symbol': 'ROK', 'date': '2023-03-22 15:50:00', 'title': 'INVESTIGATION ALERT: THE SCHALL LAW FIRM ANNOUNCES IT IS INVESTIGATING CLAIMS AGAINST ROCKWELL AUTOMATION, INC. AND ENCOURAGES INVESTORS WITH LOSSES TO CONTACT THE FIRM', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $ROK #ROK--THE SCHALL LAW FIRM ANNOUNCES IT IS INVESTIGATING CLAIMS AGAINST ROCKWELL AUTOMATION, INC.'}{'symbol': 'ROK', 'date': '2023-03-22 13:29:00', 'title': 'THE LAW OFFICES OF FRANK R. CRUZ ANNOUNCES INVESTIGATION OF ROCKWELL AUTOMATION, INC. (ROK) ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS', 'text': "LOS ANGELES--(BUSINESS WIRE)-