ION TO BUILD THE CLEANEST, SAFEST, MOST INNOVATIVE ENERGY COMPANY IN AMERICA."}{'symbol': 'STT', 'date': '2023-03-22 06:00:00', 'title': 'STATE STREET FURTHER EXPANDS OUTSOURCED TRADING CAPABILITIES', 'text': 'BOSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--STATE STREET CORPORATION (NYSE: STT) ANNOUNCED TODAY IT HAS ENTERED INTO A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE CF GLOBAL TRADING, A GLOBAL FIRM SPECIALIZING IN OUTSOURCED TRADING ON AN AGENCY BASIS FOR A VARIETY OF ASSET CLASSES INCLUDING EQUITIES, LISTED DERIVATIVES AND FIXED INCOME. THE TRANSACTION IS EXPECTED TO BE COMPLETED BY THE END OF 2023, SUBJECT TO CUSTOMARY CLOSING CONDITIONS. FINANCIAL TERMS ARE NOT BEING DISCLOSED.'}{'symbol': 'TMUS', 'date': '2023-03-22 10:00:00', 'title': "T-MOBILE CONTRIBUTES $1 MILLION TO THE SMITHSONIAN'S NEW EXHIBIT ON THE IMPACT OF WIRELESS CONNECTIVITY", 'text': "BELLEVUE, WASH.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--TODAY T-MOBILE (NASDAQ: TMUS) ANNOUNCED A $1 MILLION CONTRIBUTION TOWARD THE SMITHSONIAN NATIONAL MUSEUM OF NATURAL HISTORY'S NEW UPCOMING CELLPHONE: UNSEEN CONNECTIONS EXHIBITION TO SHARE THE JOURNEY AND IMPACT OF WIRELESS CONNECTIVITY – PAST TO PRESENT – AND INSPIRE TOMORROW'S INNOVATORS TO THINK ABOUT WHAT'S POSSIBLE INTO THE FUTURE."}{'symbol': 'TSLA', 'date': '2023-03-22 17:05:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: POMERANTZ LAW FIRM REMINDS SHAREHOLDERS WITH LOSSES ON THEIR INVESTMENT IN TESLA, INC. OF CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AND UPCOMING DEADLINE - TSLA', 'text': 'NEW YORK , MARCH 22, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- POMERANTZ LLP ANNOUNCES THAT A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS BEEN FILED AGAINST TESLA, INC. ("TESLA" OR THE "COMPANY")\xa0(NASDAQ: TSLA) AND CERTAIN OFFICERS. THE CLASS ACTION, FILED IN THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE NORTHERN DISTRICT OF CALIFORNIA, AND DOCKETED UNDER 23-CV-00869, IS ON BEHALF OF A CLASS CONSISTING OF ALL PERSONS AND ENTITIES OTHER THAN DEFENDANTS THAT PURCHASED OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRED PUBLICLY TRADED TESLA COMMON STOCK BETWEEN FEBRUARY 19, 2019 AND FEBRUARY 17, 2023, BOTH DATES INCLUSIVE (